---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy - Solar Calculator India | DPDP Act 2023 Compliant";
const description = "Privacy Policy for SolarCalculatorIndia.com. We strictly comply with India's Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act, 2023 and global privacy standards.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
      
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 font-display mb-3 break-words">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-8 break-words">
        Last Updated: November 8, 2026 | Compliant with India's Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act, 2023
      </p>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-600 space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed break-words">
        <p>
          At <strong>SolarCalculatorIndia.com</strong> ("we", "our", "us"), accessible from https://solarcalculatorindia.com, user privacy is one of our primary priorities. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information we process and how we protect your rights.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">1. 100% Client-Side Local Calculation</h3>
        <p>
          Our solar calculator algorithms, monthly bill estimations, capacity calculations, and PDF generation run entirely in your web browser. We do not store, log, or transmit your electricity bills, roof measurements, or calculation figures to any remote database.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">2. Optional Quote Requests</h3>
        <p>
          If you voluntarily choose to use our "Get 3 Free Installer Quotes" feature, you submit your name, phone number, city, and pincode. This information is processed strictly with your explicit consent to connect you with verified local MNRE solar installers in your area. We do not sell or rent this data to unauthorized third-party marketing spammers.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">3. Cookies and Web Analytics</h3>
        <p>
          Like many professional websites, we may utilize standard web cookies to analyze site traffic, prevent abuse, and optimize page load speeds. You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies or to indicate when a cookie is being sent.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">4. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising</h3>
        <p>
          We use Google AdSense and third-party advertising partners to serve relevant advertisements. Google uses cookies, including the DoubleClick DART cookie, to serve ads to users based on their visits to our site and other sites on the Internet. Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google Ads Settings (https://www.google.com/settings/ads).
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">5. Data Protection Rights under DPDP Act 2023</h3>
        <p>
          In accordance with India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDP Act, 2023), Indian users have the right to request access to their submitted contact data, request correction of any inaccuracies, or request permanent erasure of their data from our local partner dispatch logs.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 pt-3">6. Contact Our Grievance Officer</h3>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or data processing practices, please reach out via our contact page at <a href="/contact-us" class="text-emerald-600 underline font-medium">solarcalculatorindia.com/contact-us</a> or email us directly at <a href="mailto:contact@solarcalculatorindia.com" class="text-emerald-600 underline font-medium break-all">contact@solarcalculatorindia.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
